%% DM26-0670

%% A signed command. The agent's side is built, in every builder agent, and tested, but no agent declares a command yet. Everything that would bring one to it, and write down
%% what became of it, is designed and shaded (docs/architecture/commands.md, "Built so far"). Nothing subscribes to polar-command-outcome. What a command in the repository
%% does today: the scheduler processor records it as unroutable, with why, and forwards it nowhere.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant Sign as polar-sign
    participant Processor as Scheduler processor
    participant Graph as Neo4j
    participant Cassini
    participant Agent as Target agent<br/>(command actor)
    participant Handler as Command handler

    rect rgb(235, 219, 178)
    Note over Admin,Cassini: DESIGNED, not built
    Admin->>Sign: build and sign backup-now for the agent
    Sign-->>Admin: signed command with an id and an expiry
    Admin->>Processor: submit, by repository first, front door later
    Processor->>Graph: write a Command node and its status
    Processor->>Graph: mark it dispatched, and never dispatch an id twice
    Processor-)Cassini: command on agent.NAME.command
    end

    Cassini-)Agent: command on agent.NAME.command, which every builder agent subscribes to
    Agent->>Agent: the notification decodes and names this agent. Otherwise dropped and logged, with no outcome
    Agent->>Agent: two fields, chain, signature, type command, a strict payload, the target
    Agent->>Agent: authority: policy first, then c:run-command
    Agent->>Agent: not revoked, and within its window (past it: expired)
    Agent->>Agent: declared, arguments valid
    Agent->>Agent: not already seen (duplicate), not exclusive and busy, not draining
    alt any check fails
        Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome refused and the step, or expired, or duplicate
    else every check passes
        Agent->>Agent: remember the id, in a bounded set
        Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome accepted
        Agent->>Handler: run with the declared timeout
        Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome started
        alt it finishes
            Handler-->>Agent: done
            Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome succeeded and how long
        else it fails, panics, times out, or a shutdown interrupts it
            Handler-->>Agent: error
            Agent-)Cassini: CommandOutcome failed and why
        end
    end

    rect rgb(235, 219, 178)
    Note over Processor,Cassini: DESIGNED, not built
    Cassini-)Processor: CommandOutcome on polar-command-outcome
    Processor->>Graph: write an outcome node, linked to the command
    Note over Processor,Graph: Dispatched, but no outcome by the expiry
    Processor->>Graph: write unanswered, with no retry
    Admin->>Sign: a new command has a new id
    end
